WEBVTT

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:18.980
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:20.030 --> 00:00:24.510
I'm asking you
just what is that Brigadoon Project?!

00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:28.330
If you see a witch, keep away from them.

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:29.970
Mana.

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:38.290
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:41.260
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:44.970
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:04.860
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:04.860
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.780
<i>Slumbering in bed in the morning</i>

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.780
<i>asa wa nedoko de gu gu gu</i>

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:13.500
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:13.500
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:17.290
<i>Ghosts don't have school</i>

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:17.290
<i>obakenya gakkou mo</i>

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:21.170
<i>Or tests or anything</i>

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:21.170
<i>shiken mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:25.970
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:25.970
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:21.860 --> 00:02:23.090
Go.

00:02:23.090 --> 00:02:25.460
And sacrifice your life.

00:02:27.990 --> 00:02:29.400
Mother!

00:02:37.060 --> 00:02:38.750
Mother...!

00:02:39.080 --> 00:02:41.190
Mother has made her decision.

00:02:54.010 --> 00:02:56.600
Mother!

00:03:07.780 --> 00:03:09.070
A dream...?

00:03:11.320 --> 00:03:14.740
Do you think I'm being foolish, too?

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:17.080
Mother...

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:22.330
The Ring of Arcana?!

00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:24.250
CHAPTER 29

00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:29.190
THE MAD FRANKENSTEIN

00:03:30.050 --> 00:03:31.700
At any rate...

00:03:32.550 --> 00:03:35.580
Who knew the Ring of Arcana
Agnes is looking for

00:03:35.580 --> 00:03:38.710
had such a terrifying secret?

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:40.810
Yes, Dad.

00:03:41.520 --> 00:03:42.750
Fine.

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:44.860
I'll help you find your ring.

00:03:47.230 --> 00:03:48.090
However...

00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:51.610
I don't want anything else to do with you.

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:56.530
Once you have your ring,
leave Japan immediately.

00:03:57.390 --> 00:04:01.140
Like I'd stay in this
soy sauce-smelling, far-eastern country!

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:04.730
If I can stop the Brigadoon Project
I won't spend another second...

00:04:04.730 --> 00:04:09.860
I'm asking you
just what is that Brigadoon Project?!

00:04:10.210 --> 00:04:13.360
You saw Backbeard, didn't you?

00:04:13.880 --> 00:04:16.160
What he's trying to do...

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:18.620
Backbeard wants my sis--...

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:21.620
He wants Adele to
activate the ring's power

00:04:22.310 --> 00:04:26.190
to turn humans into <i>yokai</i> slaves
so he can rule them.

00:04:26.650 --> 00:04:29.550
That's the Brigadoon Project?

00:04:29.860 --> 00:04:33.550
Because of that, Miminaga
and the others' country was ruined...

00:04:33.550 --> 00:04:36.140
No, not just their country.

00:04:36.140 --> 00:04:40.620
Backbeard is trying to control
the entire world!

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:47.900
He would sacrifice both humans and <i>yokai</i>
to fulfill his own desires.

00:04:47.900 --> 00:04:49.900
How arrogant!

00:04:50.460 --> 00:04:53.780
In order to stop this Brigadoon Project,

00:04:53.780 --> 00:04:57.950
we must find the ring before they do.

00:04:57.950 --> 00:04:59.030
Right, Kitaro?

00:04:59.030 --> 00:05:00.870
Yes, Dad.

00:05:01.220 --> 00:05:06.880
But where's Agnes? It seems like she's
left the woods, but where is she staying?

00:05:06.880 --> 00:05:08.190
Who knows?

00:05:08.520 --> 00:05:09.570
Kitaro!

00:05:10.770 --> 00:05:13.320
I've located the ring! Hurry!

00:05:13.690 --> 00:05:15.300
Wait, Agnes!

00:05:18.570 --> 00:05:21.140
I was just thinking, when... Huh?

00:05:21.140 --> 00:05:22.640
-What's that?
-A drone maybe?

00:05:23.160 --> 00:05:25.620
-A person!
-She's riding a broom?!

00:05:28.210 --> 00:05:29.790
It's a witch!

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:32.050
They say it's a witch!

00:05:35.130 --> 00:05:37.860
A witch?

00:05:38.220 --> 00:05:41.140
It should be somewhere in this town...

00:05:43.850 --> 00:05:45.870
Get away from me, you pests!

00:05:45.870 --> 00:05:50.920
I found this leftover expensive Japanese
beef steak bento! You're not getting any!

00:05:50.920 --> 00:05:51.860
Shoo!

00:05:56.820 --> 00:06:01.410
You bastards!
I haven't eaten in three days, dammit!

00:06:02.200 --> 00:06:03.510
Huh? What's that?

00:06:05.520 --> 00:06:07.150
That's a ring!

00:06:07.150 --> 00:06:10.540
Who'd expect treasure
to show up on its own?

00:06:18.430 --> 00:06:20.340
Huh? Hey, hold on!

00:06:21.010 --> 00:06:22.660
-Wait!
-Huh?

00:06:22.660 --> 00:06:24.620
Please don't disappear!

00:06:33.520 --> 00:06:34.780
Agnes!

00:06:35.900 --> 00:06:36.970
Where's the ring?

00:06:36.970 --> 00:06:38.220
It disappeared...

00:06:38.220 --> 00:06:40.480
I was so close.

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:43.300
Or rather, you were late getting here!

00:06:43.700 --> 00:06:47.060
What did you intend to do
if Adele's servants showed up?!

00:06:47.060 --> 00:06:51.310
You're the one who flew off
without tellin' us where to go.

00:06:54.420 --> 00:06:57.450
It looks like you've been
searching out in the open.

00:06:57.450 --> 00:06:58.610
Of course!

00:06:58.610 --> 00:07:00.760
Without looking around you.

00:07:02.740 --> 00:07:05.680
Because of you, the town is in chaos.

00:07:08.450 --> 00:07:12.960
<i>Due to a young girl on a broom
entering the tracks,</i>

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:16.460
<i>both inbound and outbound lines
are currently stalled.</i>

00:07:17.610 --> 00:07:21.970
Next time you detect the ring,
don't run off on your own again.

00:07:22.660 --> 00:07:25.970
We don't want any more trouble
than you've already caused.

00:07:35.840 --> 00:07:36.960
Excuse me...

00:07:39.010 --> 00:07:40.880
Would you like to use this?

00:07:41.180 --> 00:07:44.160
Oh, my name's Mana Inuyama.

00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:45.660
I'm a friend of Kitaro.

00:07:46.970 --> 00:07:48.700
What about you?

00:07:49.020 --> 00:07:51.440
Could you tell me your name?

00:07:55.520 --> 00:07:59.970
It looks just like a normal broom,
doesn't it?

00:07:59.970 --> 00:08:01.220
Don't touch that!

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:07.370
When other people touch it...

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:09.850
it sometimes bites.

00:08:11.330 --> 00:08:12.650
Really?!

00:08:12.650 --> 00:08:16.080
There, there. Don't be afraid.

00:08:17.230 --> 00:08:19.300
Um, it's not a dog.

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:20.950
Shake!

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:21.740
Sit!

00:08:22.340 --> 00:08:23.340
Down!

00:08:27.260 --> 00:08:28.660
That tickles!

00:08:28.660 --> 00:08:30.370
In that case...!

00:08:30.640 --> 00:08:32.350
Tickle, tickle!

00:08:32.980 --> 00:08:35.670
I know! Have you had lunch yet?

00:08:35.670 --> 00:08:39.150
There's a delicious
sandwich store near here!

00:08:39.900 --> 00:08:43.220
I've never seen a witch before!

00:08:43.220 --> 00:08:47.140
I thought maybe we could eat together
and talk a bit.

00:08:47.140 --> 00:08:49.490
I'm busy.

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:01.070
Can you find it?

00:09:01.070 --> 00:09:03.320
Before Agnes' crystal ball?

00:09:03.320 --> 00:09:05.820
Who do you think I am?

00:09:05.820 --> 00:09:11.350
I'm not a lowly monster
like Wolfgang or Carmilla.

00:09:12.830 --> 00:09:18.340
But, to accurately detect
the Wavering Singularity

00:09:18.340 --> 00:09:24.090
I might need the absolute spiritual power
data of near where the ring disappeared.

00:09:24.090 --> 00:09:25.110
All right!

00:09:27.590 --> 00:09:28.700
I'm off!

00:09:31.030 --> 00:09:32.600
It's delicious.

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:34.650
Really? Thank goodness!

00:09:34.650 --> 00:09:36.940
I was actually really nervous.

00:09:37.580 --> 00:09:41.440
I mean, with magic you can
make any tasty meal appear, right?

00:09:41.440 --> 00:09:42.570
Like that!

00:09:43.210 --> 00:09:45.010
You're so lucky!

00:09:47.430 --> 00:09:50.950
Magic isn't really as good as all that...

00:09:56.020 --> 00:09:58.290
Thank you for the lovely sandwich.

00:09:58.290 --> 00:10:00.800
Huh? But we've barely talked about--

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:01.980
As thanks...

00:10:02.440 --> 00:10:04.320
I'll give you a word of advice.

00:10:05.400 --> 00:10:09.410
If you see a witch, keep away from them.

00:10:10.660 --> 00:10:13.240
You'll only end up hurt.

00:10:26.440 --> 00:10:28.070
Woah that's cold!

00:10:28.070 --> 00:10:29.950
This is nothing!

00:10:31.550 --> 00:10:33.990
Where is it? Is this it?

00:10:34.260 --> 00:10:36.520
Could it be...?

00:10:37.560 --> 00:10:40.620
Found it! This is it, right?

00:10:41.230 --> 00:10:42.380
Why...?

00:10:42.380 --> 00:10:44.840
It's something important, right?

00:10:44.840 --> 00:10:49.320
If I didn't hurry, it might sink
in the mud at the bottom of the pond.

00:11:13.430 --> 00:11:14.970
Oh, here!

00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:19.890
Thank you.

00:11:21.440 --> 00:11:23.540
I'm Agnes.

00:11:26.730 --> 00:11:29.490
What?! You don't have any place to stay?

00:11:30.740 --> 00:11:34.060
I don't have anywhere to go
or go back to either...

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:36.680
Then you can stay at my place!

00:11:36.680 --> 00:11:39.230
For one night, or two, or however long!

00:11:39.230 --> 00:11:41.160
Come on, Agnes-san!

00:11:41.160 --> 00:11:43.710
Just "Agnes" is fine.

00:11:44.020 --> 00:11:46.040
Oh my, look at you!

00:11:46.670 --> 00:11:49.860
Both of you into the bath right now!

00:11:53.090 --> 00:11:56.700
You'll have to wear Mana's clothes
until the laundry's done.

00:11:57.970 --> 00:12:01.540
I thought I had something a little cuter.

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:03.380
I'm really sorry.

00:12:03.380 --> 00:12:04.520
It's fine.

00:12:06.150 --> 00:12:07.840
Are you in Japan alone?

00:12:07.840 --> 00:12:09.130
Uh, yes.

00:12:09.130 --> 00:12:10.220
Sightseeing?

00:12:10.220 --> 00:12:11.800
Y-Yes.

00:12:11.800 --> 00:12:14.100
Have you already seen a lot?

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:15.510
No. Not yet.

00:12:15.510 --> 00:12:17.140
That's perfect, then!

00:12:17.140 --> 00:12:20.870
Tomorrow's a holiday,
so we can show you around.

00:12:21.290 --> 00:12:24.690
An outing with Mana, my wife,
and everyone! What fun!

00:12:24.690 --> 00:12:26.280
-No thanks.
-Huh?

00:12:26.280 --> 00:12:29.760
Seriously, don't butt in between us girls.

00:12:30.210 --> 00:12:31.440
Yes, ma'am...

00:12:32.760 --> 00:12:34.870
Stop being so depressed!

00:12:34.870 --> 00:12:36.950
We can have a date some other time.

00:12:37.220 --> 00:12:38.540
Really?!

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:42.710
You're just smooth-talking him
so he'll buy you clothes, aren't you?

00:12:42.710 --> 00:12:44.100
You are?

00:12:44.520 --> 00:12:45.460
Was it obvious?

00:12:45.460 --> 00:12:46.550
See?

00:12:46.550 --> 00:12:48.210
There's a shop I wanna go to.

00:12:48.980 --> 00:12:51.180
Sorry. My family's weird.

00:12:51.180 --> 00:12:52.460
No.

00:12:52.900 --> 00:12:54.610
It's a lovely family.

00:12:57.120 --> 00:12:59.220
What about you, Agnes?

00:12:59.220 --> 00:13:00.060
Huh?

00:13:00.060 --> 00:13:01.470
What's your family like?

00:13:33.070 --> 00:13:34.490
Agnes?

00:13:36.240 --> 00:13:37.220
Good grief.

00:13:37.490 --> 00:13:38.390
What?

00:13:38.390 --> 00:13:39.850
Nothing.

00:13:40.370 --> 00:13:45.830
I don't care about Agnes,
but since it's Mana asking...

00:13:46.960 --> 00:13:49.330
I can't just ignore it.

00:13:50.880 --> 00:13:55.880
You think they might find it rude
that I left without saying anything?

00:13:56.590 --> 00:13:59.990
Probably. They might already hate me.

00:14:00.470 --> 00:14:02.850
It's better this way.

00:14:04.430 --> 00:14:06.270
Found you!

00:14:10.420 --> 00:14:14.880
I finished my survey
and was heading back to the castle,

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:17.950
but I found
the perfect souvenir for Adele!

00:14:19.780 --> 00:14:21.240
Victor...!

00:14:23.870 --> 00:14:26.140
SURROUNDED BY WESTERN <i>YOKAI</i>!

00:14:26.910 --> 00:14:30.650
MALAY <i>YOKAI</i> BIDDY

00:14:28.710 --> 00:14:29.580
-<i>"Bottom's up!"</i>
-<i>"Let's do it!"</i>

00:14:29.710 --> 00:14:30.580
<i>"Cheers!!"</i>

00:14:30.650 --> 00:14:34.460
Now let's go back to Backbeard Castle.

00:14:35.090 --> 00:14:36.840
<i>Dainaga mi torchi!</i>

00:14:41.570 --> 00:14:42.950
Another!

00:14:45.930 --> 00:14:47.940
<i>Without looking around you.</i>

00:14:50.960 --> 00:14:53.210
Oh? You won't shoot?

00:14:53.210 --> 00:14:56.400
Then I guess it's my turn!

00:15:01.030 --> 00:15:02.310
Did that hurt?

00:15:02.310 --> 00:15:05.430
Don't worry. I won't kill you.

00:15:06.450 --> 00:15:10.270
But you know, dying might be less painful.

00:15:12.580 --> 00:15:13.840
Agnes!

00:15:15.550 --> 00:15:17.530
What are you doing to Agnes?!

00:15:17.530 --> 00:15:18.590
Mana?!

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:26.270
How insufferably lovely.

00:15:36.320 --> 00:15:40.170
I see. The reason
I came to this town today was

00:15:40.170 --> 00:15:44.640
because destiny wanted
to bring us together.

00:15:46.010 --> 00:15:47.200
Mana!

00:15:48.330 --> 00:15:52.480
Now let's go back to the castle
and hold the wedding.

00:15:53.380 --> 00:15:57.750
Or shall we have
the binding kiss right here?

00:16:01.260 --> 00:16:03.110
You give me chills.

00:16:03.510 --> 00:16:08.330
You'd have to be that lively
to be my wife.

00:16:08.330 --> 00:16:10.040
Otherwise...

00:16:10.040 --> 00:16:12.940
it won't be worth breaking you to pieces!

00:16:13.810 --> 00:16:17.320
Now let's have the binding kiss.

00:16:25.030 --> 00:16:26.430
No!

00:16:26.430 --> 00:16:28.350
Stop it, Victor!

00:16:32.290 --> 00:16:33.870
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:16:40.360 --> 00:16:41.970
Are you okay, Mana?!

00:16:42.320 --> 00:16:43.740
One more!

00:16:43.740 --> 00:16:46.290
No! Don't attack Victor!

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:47.740
Why are you stopping him?!

00:16:47.740 --> 00:16:51.560
Are you friends with that Western <i>yokai</i>
after all?!

00:16:52.180 --> 00:16:55.440
That's not it! Victor is...

00:16:56.150 --> 00:16:58.260
I fell down...

00:16:58.260 --> 00:17:02.400
It hurt!

00:17:18.750 --> 00:17:20.800
When Victor cries...

00:17:21.920 --> 00:17:25.860
his true nature as Victor Frankenstein
is revealed!

00:17:30.030 --> 00:17:31.310
Mana!

00:17:31.990 --> 00:17:33.410
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:17:43.240 --> 00:17:46.260
He's light on his feet for a big guy!

00:17:46.260 --> 00:17:47.300
Rollo Cloth!

00:17:47.300 --> 00:17:49.160
Cotton copies!

00:17:57.230 --> 00:17:58.190
Kitaro!

00:17:58.670 --> 00:18:00.560
If I'm not careful, I'll hit Mana!

00:18:19.230 --> 00:18:23.360
If we fight here,
it'll cause a commotion below.

00:18:30.660 --> 00:18:32.240
Leave this to me.

00:18:36.370 --> 00:18:37.480
Mana.

00:18:45.840 --> 00:18:47.760
Why did you come?

00:18:48.970 --> 00:18:50.990
Mana contacted me.

00:18:50.990 --> 00:18:57.020
I told her to forget about you,
but what do you think she said?

00:18:57.500 --> 00:18:59.380
She said she couldn't.

00:18:59.380 --> 00:19:01.500
Because you're her friend.

00:19:02.110 --> 00:19:03.650
Her friend...?

00:19:16.020 --> 00:19:17.410
<i>Uryukino!</i>

00:19:23.270 --> 00:19:24.880
<i>Gentskess!</i>

00:19:30.340 --> 00:19:32.140
That itches!

00:19:37.410 --> 00:19:38.810
Mana!

00:19:39.330 --> 00:19:41.060
Agnes!

00:19:57.260 --> 00:19:59.600
Thank you, Agnes!

00:20:01.940 --> 00:20:03.690
I told you.

00:20:03.690 --> 00:20:07.690
Being near me will only hurt you.

00:20:08.420 --> 00:20:11.410
But you haven't told me
anything about yourself!

00:20:11.410 --> 00:20:15.550
I want to get to know you!
I want you to tell me more...

00:20:17.060 --> 00:20:18.850
about yourself...

00:20:23.730 --> 00:20:24.810
Won't you?

00:20:27.690 --> 00:20:28.970
Thank you.

00:20:28.970 --> 00:20:30.490
Agnes!

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:34.090
Wait!

00:20:35.490 --> 00:20:41.100
I appreciate the sentiment,
but we can't be near each other.

00:20:41.100 --> 00:20:42.560
Huh? Why?

00:20:42.560 --> 00:20:43.810
Because,

00:20:43.810 --> 00:20:50.570
you're the first real friend I've found
since coming to this country.

00:20:52.050 --> 00:20:56.080
I don't want to cause trouble
for a friend.

00:20:56.080 --> 00:20:57.390
That's why...

00:20:58.260 --> 00:20:59.390
Goodbye.

00:20:59.970 --> 00:21:01.830
Where will you go?

00:21:02.680 --> 00:21:03.830
Anywhere.

00:21:03.830 --> 00:21:06.810
I'll find someplace. Don't worry about me.

00:21:12.690 --> 00:21:18.020
Catchick, doesn't the <i>Yokai</i> Apartment
have one vacancy?

00:21:18.020 --> 00:21:19.300
Huh?

00:21:20.700 --> 00:21:25.310
Yeah. But it's the north-facing room
that gets the least sunlight.

00:21:25.790 --> 00:21:27.210
Kitaro!

00:21:27.730 --> 00:21:32.070
Don't go off on your own,
and stay where I can keep an eye on you.

00:21:32.070 --> 00:21:35.070
That'll cause the least amount of trouble.

00:21:37.890 --> 00:21:39.080
Kitaro.

00:21:39.080 --> 00:21:40.560
I...

00:21:42.720 --> 00:21:44.270
I...

00:21:45.060 --> 00:21:47.830
It's only until you find the ring, okay?

00:21:50.320 --> 00:21:51.670
Agnes!

00:21:52.900 --> 00:21:54.670
Thank goodness!

00:22:06.620 --> 00:22:10.500
<i>You can't see them
But they're there</i>

00:22:06.620 --> 00:22:10.500
<i>mien keredomo orundayo</i>

00:22:12.050 --> 00:22:14.340
<i>yama de yahho</i>

00:22:12.050 --> 00:22:14.340
<i>"Hello" in the mountains</i>

00:22:14.460 --> 00:22:17.260
<i>hitokoe yobeba</i>

00:22:14.460 --> 00:22:17.260
<i>If you call</i>

00:22:17.380 --> 00:22:19.550
<i>onaji yahho</i>

00:22:17.380 --> 00:22:19.550
<i>An identical "Hello"</i>

00:22:19.680 --> 00:22:24.850
<i>yobuko ga kaesu</i>

00:22:19.680 --> 00:22:24.850
<i>The Yobuko calls back</i>

00:22:25.180 --> 00:22:27.440
<i>yama ni sunderu ki no seirei</i>

00:22:25.180 --> 00:22:27.440
<i>A tree spirit living in the mountains</i>

00:22:30.650 --> 00:22:32.860
<i>tsukatta zoukin</i>

00:22:30.650 --> 00:22:32.860
<i>A used rag</i>

00:22:32.980 --> 00:22:35.740
<i>kirei ni shinaito</i>

00:22:32.980 --> 00:22:35.740
<i>If you don't keep it clean</i>

00:22:35.990 --> 00:22:38.110
<i>kusaku nattayo</i>

00:22:35.990 --> 00:22:38.110
<i>It'll get smelly</i>

00:22:38.240 --> 00:22:43.490
<i>shirouneri karamitsuku</i>

00:22:38.240 --> 00:22:43.490
<i>The Shiro-Uneri
Will tangle itself around you</i>

00:22:43.790 --> 00:22:46.040
<i>kao ni bettori korya tamaran</i>

00:22:43.790 --> 00:22:46.040
<i>Stuck to your face
How horrible</i>

00:22:46.160 --> 00:22:51.540
<i>konnani oruyo obaketachi</i>

00:22:46.160 --> 00:22:51.540
<i>See how many ghosts there are</i>

00:22:51.670 --> 00:22:54.090
<i>mien keredomo orundayo</i>

00:22:51.670 --> 00:22:54.090
<i>You can't see them
But they're there</i>

00:22:54.210 --> 00:22:59.010
<i>mien keredomo orundayo</i>

00:22:54.210 --> 00:22:59.010
<i>You can't see them
But they're there</i>

00:22:59.760 --> 00:23:03.430
<i>kimi no chikaku ni</i>

00:22:59.760 --> 00:23:03.430
<i>They're near you</i>

00:23:06.140 --> 00:23:09.440
<i>The Western </i>yokai<i>, Carmilla, plots</i>
<i>in a movie theater.</i>

00:23:09.560 --> 00:23:11.900
<i>Dad, Catchick and Mana are...!</i>

00:23:12.610 --> 00:23:14.900
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:15.030 --> 00:23:17.150
<i>"The Vampire's Halloween Party"</i>

00:23:17.280 --> 00:23:19.910
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
